"entity": {
"name": "AWL Agri Business Ltd",
"description": "AWL Agri Business Ltd. engages in provision of edible oil, food, and fast-moving consumer goods. It also engages in sale of industry essential commodities. The firm operates through the following segments: Edible oils, Food and Fast-Moving Consumer Goods (FMCG), and Industry essentials. The Edible oils segment focuses on buying and manufacturing of edible oils. The Food and FMCG segment include buying and manufacturing of food products. The Industry essentials segment focuses on buying and manufacturing of non-edible oils and chemical product, and other vessel related operation. Its brands include Fortune, Kohinoor, King\u2019s, Raag, Jubilee, and Fryola. The company was founded in January 1999 and is headquartered in Ahmedabad, India.",
